WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:25.030
The yellow cart lay on its side.

2
00:00:25.031 --> 00:00:29.021
Pots and pans spilled onto the road.

3
00:00:29.022 --> 00:00:35.159
Food was scattered on the grass.

4
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:39.885
"What a complete mess!" said Mole.

5
00:00:39.886 --> 00:00:43.491
Rat jumped up and down.

6
00:00:43.492 --> 00:00:47.682
"Crazy drivers!" shouted Rat.

7
00:00:47.683 --> 00:00:51.885
"I'm going to call the police!"

8
00:00:51.886 --> 00:00:56.941
"Look! The horse has run away," said Mole.

9
00:00:56.942 --> 00:01:01.503
"The cart has a broken wheel," said Rat.

10
00:01:01.504 --> 00:01:06.267
"I'll go find the horse," said Mole.

11
00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:11.045
"I'll clean up this mess," said Rat.

12
00:01:11.046 --> 00:01:17.272
Toad sat in the road staring after the car.

13
00:01:17.273 --> 00:01:21.877
He had a big smile on his face.

14
00:01:21.878 --> 00:01:27.473
"Vroom! Vroom!" said Toad.

15
00:01:27.474 --> 00:01:30.551
"What?" said Rat.

16
00:01:30.552 --> 00:01:34.408
"Vroom! Vroom! Vroom!" said Toad.

17
00:01:34.409 --> 00:01:39.135
"Toad! What's the matter with you?" said Rat.

18
00:01:39.136 --> 00:01:43.682
Toad just sat in the middle of the road.

19
00:01:43.683 --> 00:01:48.068
"Vroom! Vroom!" he said.

20
00:01:48.069 --> 00:01:52.690
Rat put the broken wheel next to the cart.

21
00:01:52.691 --> 00:01:55.687
He found the birdcage on the road.

22
00:01:55.688 --> 00:01:58.877
It was upside-down.

23
00:01:58.878 --> 00:02:02.548
"Poor birdie," Rat said.

24
00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:06.427
Mole returned with the horse.

25
00:02:06.428 --> 00:02:10.229
"What's wrong with Toad?" Mole asked.

26
00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.822
"He's in some kind of dream," said Rat.

27
00:02:13.823 --> 00:02:16.476
"I wish he would help clean up."

28
00:02:16.477 --> 00:02:20.690
Toad slowly lifted his arm.

29
00:02:20.691 --> 00:02:25.742
He pointed at the far-off cloud of dust.

30
00:02:25.743 --> 00:02:31.977
"Now that's the real way to travel!" shouted Toad.

31
00:02:31.978 --> 00:02:36.124
"In a car!"
